    "sourcePrompt": "3D rotating role card showcase — three cards appear sequentially. 16s, 1920x1080, SILENT. Each card: white/light card with the role image inside, 3D perspective rotation (rotateX + rotateZ), radial-gradient shiny sweep animation, deep box-shadow. Background: dark navy gradient. Role label below card. Cards appear one at a time with open/close fades between. Exactly following the .demo CSS pattern: perspective:1000px, preserve-3d, counter-rotating wrapper + content, translateZ on image, radial shiny overlay\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@700;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n*,*:before,*:after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}\nbody,#scene{width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;}\n#scene{\nposition:relative\nbackground:linear-gradient(160deg,#0d1117 0%,#131a2e 60%,#0a0f1e 100%)\ndisplay:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\n}\n/* card stage */\ncard-stage{\nposition:absolute\ndisplay:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center\nopacity:0\n}\n/* demo wrapper — counter-rotation */\ndemo{\nposition:relative\nwidth:320px;height:460px\nperspective:1000px\ntransform-style:preserve-3d\nanimation:rotateReverse 3s infinite linear\n}\n/* content — forward rotation */\ndemo__content{\nposition:relative\nwidth:100%;height:100%\ntransform-style:preserve-3d\nanimation:rotate 3s infinite linear\ntransform:rotateX(10deg) rotateZ(0)\nbackground:#fff\nborder-radius:4px\n}\ndemo__content:before{\ncontent:\"\"\nz-index:-1\nposition:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%\nbox-shadow:0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.55)\nborder-radius:4px\n}\n/* image inside card — translateZ to float above */\ndemo__img{\noverflow:hidden\nposition:absolute\nleft:16px;top:16px\nwidth:288px;height:390px\ntransform:translateZ(6px) scale(0.97)\nborder-radius:2px\n}\ndemo__img img{\nwidth:100%;height:100%\nobject-fit:cover;display:block\nfilter:grayscale(15%) contrast(1.08)\n}\n/* shiny sweep overlay */\ndemo__img:after{\ncontent:\"\"\nz-index:2\nposition:absolute;left:-20%;top:0\nwidth:80%;padding-bottom:80%\nborder-radius:50%\nbackground:radial-gradient(ellipse farthest-corner at center,rgba(255,255,255,0.25) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%)\ntransform:translateY(-100%)\nanimation:shiny 3s infinite ease-in-out\npointer-events:none\n}\n/* role label below card */\nrole-label{\nmargin-top:28px\ntext-align:center\nopacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\n}\nrole-label .type{\nfont-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif\nfont-size:12px;font-weight:700\nletter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase\ncolor:rgba(240,236,228,0.45);margin-bottom:8px\n}\nrole-label .name{\nfont-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif\nfont-size:44px;font-weight:700\ncolor:#f0ece4;line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.01em\n}\nrole-label .year{\nfont-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif\nfont-size:13px;font-weight:400\nletter-spacing:.20em;text-transform:uppercase\ncolor:rgba(240,236,228,0.35);margin-top:8px\n}\n@keyframes rotate{\n100%{transform:rotateX(10deg) rotateZ(360deg);}\n}\n@keyframes rotateReverse{\n100%{transform:rotateZ(-360deg);}\n}\n@keyframes shiny{\n25%{transform:translateY(-100%);}\n50%{transform:translateY(480px);}\n50.1%{transform:translate(75%,480px);}\n75%{transform:translate(75%,-100%);}\n}\n#open-fade,#close-fade{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:50;background:#0d1117;pointer-events:none;}\n#open-fade{opacity:1;}\n#close-fade{opacity:0;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"scene\">\n<div id=\"open-fade\"></div>\n<div id=\"close-fade\"></div>\n<!-- Card 1: Turing -->\n<div class=\"card-stage\" id=\"s1\">\n<div class=\"demo\">\n<div class=\"demo__content\">\n<div class=\"demo__img\">\n<img src=\"{{img1}}\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"role-label\" id=\"l1\">\n<div class=\"type\">Film · 2014</div>\n<div class=\"name\">Alan Turing</div>\n<div class=\"year\">The Imitation Game</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Card 2: Sherlock -->\n<div class=\"card-stage\" id=\"s2\">\n<div class=\"demo\">\n<div class=\"demo__content\">\n<div class=\"demo__img\">\n<img src=\"{{img2}}\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"role-label\" id=\"l2\">\n<div class=\"type\">Television · 2010</div>\n<div class=\"name\">Sherlock Holmes</div>\n<div class=\"year\">BBC One</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Card 3: Hamlet -->\n<div class=\"card-stage\" id=\"s3\">\n<div class=\"demo\">\n<div class=\"demo__content\">\n<div class=\"demo__img\">\n<img src=\"{{img3}}\" alt=\"\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"role-label\" id=\"l3\">\n<div class=\"type\">Stage · 2015</div>\n<div class=\"name\">Hamlet</div>\n<div class=\"year\">Barbican Theatre, London</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"vendor/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){\nvar tl=gsap.timeline()\n/* open */\ntl.to('#open-fade',{opacity:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power2.out'},0.0)\n/* CARD 1 */\ntl.set('#s1',{opacity:1},0.4)\ntl.to('#s1',{opacity:1,scale:1,duration:0.6,ease:'back.out(1.2)',startAt:{scale:0.85}},0.4)\ntl.to('#l1',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power3.out'},0.7)\ntl.to('#l1',{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:0.35,ease:'power2.in'},4.5)\ntl.to('#s1',{opacity:0,scale:0.88,duration:0.4,ease:'power2.in'},4.6)\ntl.set('#s1',{opacity:0},5.1)\n/* CARD 2 */\ntl.set('#s2',{opacity:1},5.0)\ntl.to('#s2',{opacity:1,scale:1,duration:0.6,ease:'back.out(1.2)',startAt:{scale:0.85}},5.0)\ntl.to('#l2',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power3.out'},5.3)\ntl.to('#l2',{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:0.35,ease:'power2.in'},9.5)\ntl.to('#s2',{opacity:0,scale:0.88,duration:0.4,ease:'power2.in'},9.6)\ntl.set('#s2',{opacity:0},10.1)\n/* CARD 3 */\ntl.set('#s3',{opacity:1},10.0)\ntl.to('#s3',{opacity:1,scale:1,duration:0.6,ease:'back.out(1.2)',startAt:{scale:0.85}},10.0)\ntl.to('#l3',{opacity:1,y:0,duration:0.5,ease:'power3.out'},10.3)\ntl.to('#l3',{opacity:0,y:-8,duration:0.35,ease:'power2.in